#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_GuestsDoubledByMascot"
msgid ""
"Hm, so they doubled the guests by\n"
"using POKéMON as attractions?\p"
"Hm, well, maybe I should make a cute\n"
"POKéMON our inn's mascot.\p"
"I wonder if that will attract more\n"
"guests to stay with us?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，他们用宝可梦招揽客人，\n"
"客人就翻了一倍？\p"
"嗯，或许我也该让可爱的宝可梦\n"
"当我们旅馆的吉祥物。\p"
"不知道这样能不能吸引\n"
"更多客人来住呢？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_NoGuestsWithTeamAqua"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry, sorry!\n"
"I was too involved in watching TV!\p"
"Since that TEAM AQUA came to town,\n"
"the tourists have been staying away.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，抱歉抱歉！\n"
"我看电视看得太入迷了！\p"
"自从那个海洋队来到城里，\n"
"游客就都不来了。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:90
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_CantSeeTheTV"
msgid ""
"Hey, down in front!\n"
"I can't see the TV!$"
msgstr ""
"喂，前面的蹲下！\n"
"我看不到电视了！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:94
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_MonFoundLostItem"
msgid ""
"Amazing! You're telling me a POKéMON\n"
"found someone's lost item?\p"
"That's something. If we had some smart\n"
"POKéMON like that…\p"
"We could recover anything that our\n"
"guests mislaid…$"
msgstr ""
"太厉害了！你是说有宝可梦\n"
"找到了别人丢失的东西？\p"
"真了不起。要是我们也有\n"
"那么聪明的宝可梦……\p"
"客人们丢了什么东西，\n"
"就都能找回来了……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:102
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_HeardAquaHideoutBusted"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry, sorry!\n"
"I was too involved in watching TV!\p"
"I heard that someone busted\n"
"the TEAM AQUA HIDEOUT.\p"
"Thanks to that, we just booked\n"
"a reservation from a big group.\p"
"It was a company called… Uh…\n"
"GAME something…$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，抱歉抱歉！\n"
"我看电视看得太入迷了！\p"
"听说有人捣毁了\n"
"海洋队的基地。\p"
"多亏了这个，我们刚刚接到了\n"
"一个大型团体的预订。\p"
"是一家叫做……呃……\n"
"GAME什么的公司……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:112
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_HouseSittingMonCaughtBurglar"
msgid ""
"Amazing! A house-sitting POKéMON\n"
"caught a burglar?\p"
"That's something. If we had a tough\n"
"POKéMON as a security guard…\p"
"We would be able to provide our guests\n"
"with greater safety.$"
msgstr ""
"太厉害了！看家的宝可梦\n"
"抓住了小偷？\p"
"真了不起。要是我们也有\n"
"强壮的宝可梦当保安……\p"
"就能让客人们\n"
"住得更安心了。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_1F_Text_BetterGetWorkingOnGuestsDinner"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry, sorry!\n"
"I was too involved in watching TV.\p"
"Oh, yes. A big group of guests arrived\n"
"a little while ago.\p"
"They booked in as GAME FREAK,\n"
"so I guess they must make games.\p"
"Uh-oh, I'd better get working on\n"
"their dinner!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，抱歉抱歉！\n"
"我看电视看得太入迷了。\p"
"哦，对了。刚才来了\n"
"一大群客人。\p"
"他们登记的名字是GAME FREAK，\n"
"所以应该是做游戏的吧。\p"
"哎呀，我得赶紧去准备\n"
"他们的晚饭了！$"
